<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Rethinking Verification for LLM Code Generation: 
<br class="ltx_break">From Generation to Testing</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Zihan Ma,
Taolin Zhang,
Maosong Cao,
Wenwei Zhang
